1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Hello, can I help you?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,553
I was told to come here,

3
00:00:03,553 --> 00:00:06,960
because I'd like to talk to someone about taking a management course.

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:07,565
Right.

5
00:00:07,565 --> 00:00:08,447
I'm one of the tutors,

6
00:00:08,447 --> 00:00:10,430
so I should be able to help you.

7
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:11,107
Oh, good.

8
00:00:11,107 --> 00:00:12,460
My name's Brian Ardley.

9
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:15,842
I've decided to enroll on a part- time management course.

10
00:00:15,842 --> 00:00:18,549
A friend of mine took one last year,

11
00:00:18,549 --> 00:00:20,240
and recommended it to me.

12
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:20,910
Right.

13
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:25,200
Is there anything I should do before the course, like reading or anything?

14
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,755
We prefer to integrate reading with the course,

15
00:00:27,755 --> 00:00:30,949
so we don't give out a reading list in advance.

16
00:00:30,949 --> 00:00:35,420
But we like people to write a case study, describing an organization they know.

17
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:38,524
I've already done that, my friends told me you wanted one.

18
00:00:38,524 --> 00:00:42,474
But would it be possible to sit in on a teaching session, to see

19
00:00:42,474 --> 00:00:43,321
what it's like?

20
00:00:43,321 --> 00:00:45,860
I haven't been a student for quite a while.

21
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:46,147
Fine.

22
00:00:46,147 --> 00:00:47,870
Just let me know which date,

23
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:49,880
and I'll arrange it with the tutor.

24
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:53,290
Now, could I ask you about the college facilities, please?

25
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:54,890
Anything in particular?

26
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:59,128
Well, the course is one day a week, all day, isn't it?

27
00:00:59,128 --> 00:01:01,600
So presumably it's possible to buy food?

28
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,670
Yes, the refectory's open all day.

29
00:01:03,670 --> 00:01:05,814
Does it cater for special diets?

30
00:01:05,814 --> 00:01:07,600
I have some food allergies.

31
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:10,800
Provided you warn the refectory in advance, it won't be a problem.

32
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:11,165
Good.

33
00:01:11,165 --> 00:01:13,353
What about facilities for young children?

34
00:01:13,353 --> 00:01:17,000
I'd like to bring my daughter here while I'm studying.

35
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,020
How old is she?

36
00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:18,560
Three.

37
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,755
Then she's eligible to join the nursery,

38
00:01:20,755 --> 00:01:23,263
which is supervised by a qualified Nursery Nurse.

39
00:01:23,263 --> 00:01:26,399
The waiting list for a place is quite long though,

40
00:01:26,399 --> 00:01:28,280
so you ought to apply now.

41
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:28,800
OK.

42
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:32,244
I don't know if our careers advice service would be of any interest to

43
00:01:32,244 --> 00:01:32,490
you?

44
00:01:32,490 --> 00:01:37,150
yes, it might help me decide how to develop my career after the course.

45
00:01:37,150 --> 00:01:39,799
The centre has a lot of reference materials,

46
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:43,110
and staff qualified to give guidance on a one-to-one basis.

47
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:46,149
I noticed a fitness centre next to the college.

48
00:01:46,149 --> 00:01:47,500
Is that for students?

49
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:48,564
It's open to everyone,

50
00:01:48,564 --> 00:01:52,290
but students pay an annual fee that's much less than the general public pay.

51
00:01:52,290 --> 00:01:57,930
And presumably the college library stocks newspapers and journals, as well as books?

52
00:01:57,930 --> 00:01:58,281
Yes,

53
00:01:58,281 --> 00:02:02,846
and there's also an audio-visual room, for viewing and listening to videos, cassettes,

54
00:02:02,846 --> 00:02:03,900
and so on.

55
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:06,390
Is there also access to computers?

56
00:02:06,390 --> 00:02:09,951
Yes, your tutor will need to arrange with the technical support team for you

57
00:02:09,951 --> 00:02:10,968
to get a password,

58
00:02:10,968 --> 00:02:14,020
so ask him or her about it when you start the course.

59
00:02:14,020 --> 00:02:14,530
OK.

60
00:02:14,530 --> 00:02:18,100
By the way, do you know about our Business Centre?

61
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:18,640
No.

62
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:19,720
What's that?

63
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:24,277
It's a training resource-a collection of materials for people to study on their own,

64
00:02:24,277 --> 00:02:26,230
or use in their own organizations.

65
00:02:26,230 --> 00:02:26,633
Uhuh.

66
00:02:26,633 --> 00:02:28,650
You mean books and videos?

67
00:02:28,650 --> 00:02:29,084
Yes,

68
00:02:29,084 --> 00:02:30,820
and manuals for self-study.

69
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:32,724
Plus a lot of computer-based materials,

70
00:02:32,724 --> 00:02:35,898
so people can work through them at their own speed,

71
00:02:35,898 --> 00:02:38,120
and repeat anything they aren't sure about.

72
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:41,675
And you can hire laptops to use in your own home

73
00:02:41,675 --> 00:02:45,230
or workplace as well as printers that you can take away.

74
00:02:45,230 --> 00:02:49,386
Does it have anything that I could use to improve my study skills?

75
00:02:49,386 --> 00:02:51,943
I don't have much idea about report writing,

76
00:02:51,943 --> 00:02:54,820
and I'm sure I'll need it on the course.

77
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:56,963
Oh yes, there's plenty of useful material.

78
00:02:56,963 --> 00:02:58,800
Just ask one of the staff.

79
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:02,020
Does the centre cover all the main areas of business?

80
00:03:02,020 --> 00:03:03,401
Yes, topics like finance,

81
00:03:03,401 --> 00:03:05,818
and of course marketing-that's a popular one.

82
00:03:05,818 --> 00:03:09,270
Local managers seem to queue up to borrow the videos!

83
00:03:09,270 --> 00:03:11,350
So it isn't just for students, then?

84
00:03:11,350 --> 00:03:13,556
No, it's for members only,

85
00:03:13,556 --> 00:03:15,320
but anyone can join.

86
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,470
How much does it cost?

87
00:03:16,470 --> 00:03:18,740
￡100 a year for a company,

88
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:23,280
and ￡50 for an individual, with no discount for students, I'm afraid.

89
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,218
That's very helpful.

90
00:03:24,218 --> 00:03:25,781
Well, I think that's all.

91
00:03:25,781 --> 00:03:28,907
I'd better go home and fill in the enrolment form.

92
00:03:28,907 --> 00:03:30,470
Thanks for all your help.

93
00:03:30,470 --> 00:03:31,423
You're welcome.

94
00:03:31,423 --> 00:03:31,900
Goodbye.

95
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:32,100
Goodbye.
